#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log an alert or send an email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Ikiwa muda wa kwenda na kurudi kupitia mojawapo ya mbinu za ping za Cacti zilizobainishwa awali utazidi kizingiti hiki, andika tahadhari kwenye kumbukumbu au tuma barua pepe kulingana na Umuhimu wa Vifaa na mpangilio wa Ufuatiliaji. Kipimo ni milisekunde. Kuweka 0 huzima. Programu-jalizi ya Thold inahitajika ili kutumia kipengele hiki."

